      "tag": "Rule",
      "h2": "BIDMAS order",
      "body_html": "<p><strong>B</strong>rackets first, <strong>I</strong>ndices (powers), then <strong>D</strong>ivision and <strong>M</strong>ultiplication (left to right), finally <strong>A</strong>ddition and <strong>S</strong>ubtraction (left to right).</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Worked",
      "h2": "Simple example",
      "body_html": "<p>Evaluate <strong>3 + 4 × 2</strong>.</p><p>Multiplication first: 4 × 2 = 8.</p><p>Then add: 3 + 8 = <strong>11</strong>.</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Brackets",
      "h2": "Brackets first",
      "body_html": "<p>Evaluate <strong>(3 + 4) × 2</strong>.</p><p>Brackets first: 3 + 4 = 7.</p><p>Then multiply: 7 × 2 = <strong>14</strong>.</p>"
    }
  ],
